# Loaded only for `vite --mode demo` (demo.bat). A mode-specific env file takes priority
# over .env, so this is how the demo frontend finds the demo backend.
#
# It exists because the alternative did NOT work: demo.bat used to set VITE_API_BASE in the
# shell, and `set VAR=value && cmd` in a batch file stores the value WITH A TRAILING SPACE.
# Every request then went to "http://127.0.0.1:8001 /metrics" and the app came up unable to
# load anything. A committed file has no quoting to get wrong.
VITE_API_BASE=http://127.0.0.1:8001
